"Those beautiful moments that should be remembered, let us help you record them."-Master of Time Management.

Time management master can help you make good use of your precious time and make more value in the limited time. You must have suffered from the lack of appropriate tools to remind the time that a certain plan took too long, or even use traditional paper And calendar methods to remind yourself. Time management masters will appear every time you need reminders. Our purpose is not just to hope that you can control your time and arrange your plans reasonably. We are keen to build a good for you The concept of time, so that every user who uses the time management master can become a real time master.

It takes a lot of hard work to become a self-disciplined and efficient person, but also to make reasonable use of our few and precious unusual time. You certainly don’t want to lose your plan due to forgetting time. The benefits of this app are not only Only in one aspect, specifically: the master of time management will remind you: how many days are left for the birthday of the lover? How many days are left for the credit card repayment? How many days are left for the salary? How many days are left for the favorite drama to update ? All these important days for you will be recorded in detail, we will remind you in time after the arrival time, please don't miss every moment and important moment in your life.

The advantage of our app is that it is concise but not simple, important and not complicated. We will record every important moment in your life for you with the smallest content. We provide a lot of beautiful and concise backgrounds. Of course you can also customize Set the background to the picture you like. The meaning of time is never how much time you have or how much time you lose. The meaning of time is that you should use these precious time reasonably and cherished. Every successful person is good at managing his own time , Do effective things within a limited time frame. The losers are on the contrary, a lot of time is wasted, and these precious time that should be cherished and cherished are wasted on meaningless things. Time never self Prove the value, and those who use time define the value of time.

[Features]
# Fully support the latest iOS 14 and iPadOS 14 system widgets;
# Can be accurate to the second, always remind you to cherish your time and see the changes in time;
# Support reminders, remind you of upcoming events through push notifications;
#Support live wallpaper;
# Support the selection of the lunar calendar, do not miss every lunar festival;
# Customizable widget background, custom widget color, and personalized widget definition;
#Support daily, monthly, and yearly recalculation;
#Built-in multiple gadgets, including "CPU Panel", "Age Calculator", "Full Screen Clock", etc.
#Support event sticking;
#Support automatic sorting of events;
#Support classification management function, to better help you manage all event reminders;
#You can set the background for each event, a small and beautiful time reminder application;
#Support the function of backing up data to iCloud, no longer have to worry about data loss;
# Provide a variety of cool animations to give you a different mood;
# Customizable push notification ringtones to make you unique;
# Brand new and fresh and simple operation interface, making the operation more concise;
# Support percentage form.

